** RavenMUD world update!!!! **

The village of Chisha has been uncovered after years of going unnoticed due to magical protection.

** Easter Quest **

Congratulations to Airen, Bregnar, and Mulgrave, our top three Easter egg hunters! Thanks
to everyone that participated. We'll have to give it a try again next Easter.

** Advancement **

Advance is still being developed, hey it's gotta come some time right? If you're not familiar
with the new advancement options around the corner, check your class guild boards for more
information.




